title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM CPU
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows the average vCPU utilization of a running VM. Levels can
 be configured; there are none by default. Data comes from the special agent
 {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer VM CPU} per VM.
